  "The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Gambar yang kini berada di belakang apl",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Kawasan pemain tidak pernah mendapat saiz, jadi main balik tidak dimulakan.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Pemain itu sendiri — penyahkodan, sari kata dan audio. GPLv2 atau lebih baharu.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Projek ini tidak mengehos, mengendali, menyokong atau mengesyorkan mana-mana sumber, dan tidak mengedarkan senarainya.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Projek ini di GitHub",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Keluaran ini tidak membawa kemas kini untuk platform ini.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Sumber sudah mengambilnya — ia dimainkan serta-merta dan tidak meninggalkan apa-apa pada peranti ini",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Senarai penyokong tidak dapat dimuatkan — halaman Ko-fi di atas mempunyai yang terkini.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Enjin torrent menerima magnet itu tetapi tidak memberinya ID.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Enjin torrent, terbenam dalam apl. Berlesen MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Strim torrent belum sedia (enjin menjawab HTTP {status}). Ia mungkin masih mengambil metadata daripada rakan setara.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Kemas kini tidak dapat dipasang: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Di sini hampir tiada ruang untuk satu filem pun. Pasangkan pemacu USB pada kotak — diformat sebagai FAT32, yang diterima setiap kotak Android — dan ia akan muncul di atas untuk dimuat turun ke situ.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Tiada akaun untuk log masuk dan tiada apa disegerakkan ke pelayan. Apa yang anda tonton, sejauh mana anda sampai, kegemaran anda dan senarai tontonan anda semuanya disimpan pada peranti ini dan tidak pernah meninggalkannya. Penyegerakan antara skrin sedang dirancang; sehingga itu, sandaran di bawah ialah cara pustaka berpindah.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Tiada {file} dalam folder dokumen anda. Salin satu ke sana dan cuba lagi.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Sambungan ini bermeter buat masa ini.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Sambungan ini tidak bermeter buat masa ini.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Salinan ini bukan dipasang oleh pemasang Ventic sendiri — sebaliknya oleh pengurus pakej, atau dibina daripada sumber — jadi apa yang meletakkannya di situ itulah yang mengemas kininya. Menggantikan failnya dari sini hanya akan mengelirukannya.",
  "This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.",
  "This device is called": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device is called",
  "This device is streaming a film to another one right now.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device is streaming a film to another one right now.",
  "This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.",
  "This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Penyahkod peranti ini menyerah pada fail itu. Biasanya puncanya audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) dan DTS tidak dilesenkan ke dalam paparan web sistem, jadi keluaran yang membawanya dimainkan sebagai gambar tanpa bunyi, atau langsung tidak. Keluaran x264 dengan audio AAC akan dimainkan.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Fail ini mempunyai satu trek audio.",
